        "Anglers fishing between Fishing Brook Bog and County Line Flow must stay within the 33-foot Public Fishing Rights corridor.",
        "County Line Flow contains brook trout.",
        "Anglers can fish in County Line Flow from canoes, kayaks or small boats.",
        "Canoes, kayaks and small boats can be launched at the hand launch on the southern shore of County Line Flow.",
        "Shoreline fishing at County Line Flow is prohibited.",
        "Other shore access at County Line Flow is prohibited.",
        "Page 1 directs anglers to information on fishing seasons, rules and regulations.",
        "Anglers should check fishing seasons, rules and regulations when planning a fishing outing."
    ]
}
